# Keys live in two gitignored files, one per app. Copy each .example and fill in:
#
#   services/api/.env.example -> services/api/.env   GRID_* (brief source, gateway virtual key, Baseten key)
#   web/.env.example          -> web/.env            VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY (optional address autocomplete)
#
# Which backend produces the brief: fixtures | agent | full. Set in services/api/.env as GRID_BRIEF_SOURCE.
